I've been hosting the jboselkei lojban translation game since 2013 (I am 
not the original author but I offered to host it after it had been offline 
for a few years prior) but my web hosting account expires in a few days. It 
is at http://lojban.qx11.info/jboselkei/index.php . Since it has little 
activity and my other website don't get any visitors I plan not to renew my 
web hosting account so I will not be able to host jboselkei anymore. I plan 
to save the source code and database so if anyone else is interested in 
hosting it I can send the files. Keep in mind that it has had a small 
amount of activity and I wouldn't expect it to increase.

